  "historyNote": "#9037, INTERIM, eff 11-27-07, EXPIRED: 5-25-08 New. #9169, eff 6-3-08; ss by #10741, eff 12-5-14 (from Puc 2502.20); ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18 (formerly Puc 2502.21)",
